{"study_accession":"PRJNA700968","secondary_study_accession":"SRP305489","title":"Transcriptome profiling of hematopoietic progenitor cells (HPC) transduced with transcription factors T-BET or EOMES","description":"T-BET and EOMES are key transcription factors in the development of mature Natural Killer (NK) cells in mice. However, the role of these transcription factors during human NK cell development is less well understood. Therefore, we overexpressed T-BET or EOMES in human umbilical cord blood-derived HPC and cultured them in vitro in an NK cell differentiation model. To evaluate the effect of early overexpression of T-BET and EOMES in HPC, transcriptome profiling was performed on T-BET and EOMES overexpressing HPC and compared to control transduced HPC by RNA sequencing on day 0 of culture. Overall design: mRNA profile of cord blood-derived HPC transduced with transcription factors T-BET or EOMES in comparison to control transduced cells.","pubmed":"34630413","geo_series":"","n_samples":15,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17841235","study_accession":"PRJNA700968","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"RNA-seq_A Control","description":"RNA-seq_A Control","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5071179","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-08-29","attributes":[["source_name","Hematopoietic stem cell"],["tissue","umbilical cord blood"],["cell_type","Hematopoietic stem cell"],["donor","Donor A"],["treatment","Retroviral transduction"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13666678","experiment_accession":"SRX10058245","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":7106961,"base_count":534660490,"first_public":"2021-08-29","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM5071179: RNA-seq_A Control Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17841244","study_accession":"PRJNA700968","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"RNA-seq_E T-BET",